  "version": "families-v3",
  "about": "Model lineage for judge independence. Effective families = families (brand/vendor) + base (base-model lineage). Two models overlap when they share any effective family. Unknown fails closed. Fine-tune brands (patterns with brand=true) resolve to unknown unless an explicit models/files entry gives their base lineage. Patterns match the weight-file basename or the alias. Served identity is resolved first: sha256 (when pinned; an unpinned sha with a non-empty table is a conflict) -> files -> models -> patterns. Read by evals/grading.py (family_overlap) and evals/run.py, evals/report.py.",
